# D3-SU-003: Passivated alloy and bare iron are not equivalent aqueous inputs
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 NaCl 0.005mol
add v1 stainless_steel 1g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 NaCl 0.005mol
add v2 Fe 0.70g
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
add v1 O2 0.003mol
add v2 O2 0.003mol
wait 72h
look v1
look v2
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
inspect
